<section class="gg-hero gg-premium-hero">
  <div class="gg-bg-orb orb-one"></div>
  <div class="gg-bg-orb orb-two"></div>
  <div class="gg-bg-orb orb-three"></div>

  <div class="gg-container gg-hero-grid">
    <div class="gg-hero-copy reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Goal Grower App</span>

      <h1>A garden for the life you're trying to build.</h1>

      <p>
        Every goal becomes a plant. Every action helps it grow.
        Build meaningful habits, return after imperfect days, and watch your progress come to life.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions">
        <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn">Support Development</a>
        <a href="#runthrough" class="gg-btn-soft">Watch Runthrough</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-phone-showcase reveal">
      <div class="gg-floating-stat stat-1">
        <strong>24</strong>
        <span>Goals watered</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-floating-stat stat-2">
        <strong>7</strong>
        <span>Days returned</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-floating-stat stat-3">
        <strong>3</strong>
        <span>Shared gardens</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-android-phone main-phone">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-before-placed-garden-view.png' | asset_img_url: '1000x' | img_tag: 'Goal Grower garden screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-mini-phone phone-float-one">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker small"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-only-goal-list-view.png' | asset_img_url: '700x' | img_tag: 'Goal Grower goal list screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-belief-flow">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-belief-panel reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">The feeling</span>
      <h2>Progress should feel like care, not pressure.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower is built for real life — fresh starts, slow growth, shared encouragement,
        and the small daily actions that quietly change who you become.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-stacked-story" id="journey">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">How it works</span>
      <h2>Your goal becomes a living thing.</h2>
      <p>The cards stack as the story moves forward, like moving through the app.</p>
    </div>

    <article class="gg-stack-story-card card-create reveal">
      <div class="gg-stack-copy">
        <span>01 / Create</span>
        <h3>Start with a goal that matters.</h3>
        <p>Add the reason, the habit, the project, or the future version of yourself you are trying to grow.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-stack-phone">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-add-goal-saving-read-more-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Create goal screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="gg-stack-story-card card-empty reveal">
      <div class="gg-stack-copy">
        <span>02 / Begin</span>
        <h3>Go from empty space to intention.</h3>
        <p>The app gives your goals a home instead of letting them disappear into another list.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-stack-phone">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-no-goals-yet.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'No goals yet screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="gg-stack-story-card card-garden reveal">
      <div class="gg-stack-copy">
        <span>03 / Garden</span>
        <h3>Place your effort somewhere visible.</h3>
        <p>Each goal becomes part of a garden, turning consistency into something you can see.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-stack-phone">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-before-placed-garden-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Garden screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="gg-stack-story-card card-details reveal">
      <div class="gg-stack-copy">
        <span>04 / Details</span>
        <h3>Track the growth behind the plant.</h3>
        <p>See the goal, progress, and details that help the habit become real.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-stack-phone">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-goal-details-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Goal details screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-runthrough-section" id="runthrough">
  <div class="gg-container gg-two-col">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">App runthrough</span>
      <h2>Watch the garden system in motion.</h2>
      <p>
        Show people how Goal Grower feels before they download or support it.
        This is where the app becomes real.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-video-frame reveal">
      <video
        src="{{ 'Screen_Recording_goal-grower-runthrough.mp4' | asset_url }}"
        controls
        playsinline
        preload="metadata"
      ></video>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-living-section">
  <div class="gg-container gg-two-col">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker light">Why it feels different</span>
      <h2>A goal tracker with emotional feedback.</h2>
      <p>
        Instead of making progress feel like a scoreboard, Goal Grower makes it feel like something living.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-living-list reveal">
      <div>
        <strong>Visual memory</strong>
        <span>Your garden reminds you what you are building.</span>
      </div>

      <div>
        <strong>Gentle return</strong>
        <span>Imperfect days do not erase the person you are becoming.</span>
      </div>

      <div>
        <strong>Shared growth</strong>
        <span>Grow with people without turning accountability into pressure.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-gallery-flow" id="screenshots">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Screenshots</span>
      <h2>Real screens. Real flow.</h2>
      <p>
        A calmer way to create goals, track progress, and see your effort become visual.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-gallery-stack">
      <div class="gg-gallery-device reveal">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-no-goals-yet.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'No goals screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-gallery-device reveal">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-add-goal-saving-read-more-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Add goal screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-gallery-device reveal featured-gallery-device">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-before-placed-garden-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Garden screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-gallery-device reveal">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-only-goal-list-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Goal list screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-gallery-device reveal">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-goal-details-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Goal details screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-shared-flow">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-shared-panel reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="gg-kicker">Shared gardens</span>
        <h2>Grow with people who are growing too.</h2>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p>
          Create shared gardens with friends, spouses, classmates, roommates, or accountability partners.
          Everyone works on their own goals while contributing to something together.
        </p>

        <div class="gg-shared-pills">
          <span>Friends</span>
          <span>Family</span>
          <span>Classmates</span>
          <span>Partners</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-growth-flow">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Growth loop</span>
      <h2>Small actions become visible identity.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-growth-line">
      <div class="gg-growth-node reveal">
        <span>Seed</span>
        <p>Create the goal.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-growth-node reveal">
        <span>Sprout</span>
        <p>Take first action.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-growth-node reveal">
        <span>Plant</span>
        <p>Build consistency.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-growth-node reveal">
        <span>Bloom</span>
        <p>Reach milestones.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-maker-flow">
  <div class="gg-container gg-two-col">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker light">Built by a student</span>
      <h2>Designed by someone who needed it too.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower is being built to make progress feel less cold and more alive:
        part app, part garden, part reminder that growth takes time.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-maker-card reveal">
      <h3>Current progress</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Goal tracking built</li>
        <li>Personal gardens built</li>
        <li>Shared gardens in beta</li>
        <li>Android testing next</li>
        <li>Widgets and reminders future</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-store-flow">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Support the build</span>
      <h2>Help the garden keep growing.</h2>
      <p>
        Support Goal Grower development, future apps, digital tools, and products made for intentional growth.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-store-flow-grid">
      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-store-flow-card reveal">
        <span>Main</span>
        <h3>Goal Grower Support</h3>
        <p>Help fund development, design, testing, and future features.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-store-flow-card reveal">
        <span>Tools</span>
        <h3>Digital Products</h3>
        <p>Templates, planners, and intentional growth resources.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-store-flow-card reveal">
        <span>Objects</span>
        <h3>Physical Products</h3>
        <p>Merch, desk items, and calming productivity products.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-final-cta gg-final-flow">
  <div class="gg-container reveal">
    <span class="gg-kicker">The mission</span>
    <h2>Build a life you can keep returning to.</h2>
    <p>
      Goal Grower is about making progress feel human, hopeful, and worth caring about.
    </p>
    <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn">Support Development</a>
  </div>
</section>

